1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,200
One smart agent runs the whole bot.
Who checks its work?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Split the job.
One agent per question.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,600
Scan finds what moved.

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,100
Filter drops what does not fit.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,200
Risk sizes it and guards the book.

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,200
Execute only sends the order.

7
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,800
Five signals arrive.
Scan hands over five tickets.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Filter says no to three.
Every no is written down.

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:31,000
Risk refuses one and sizes the other.

10
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,000
One order leaves.
Four no's on file.

11
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,200
Now change one thing:
risk moves into execute.

12
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,000
Same signals. Two orders.
Nobody said no.

13
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:45,000
One bot, four agents.
Log every no.
